notes.body:
You need to add

```
                ${LZ4_INCLUDE_DIRS}
```

to the `SYSTEM PRIVATE` list in

```
target_include_directories(epan
	SYSTEM PRIVATE
		${BROTLI_INCLUDE_DIRS}
		${CARES_INCLUDE_DIRS}
		${GLIB2_INCLUDE_DIRS}
		${GNUTLS_INCLUDE_DIRS}
		${GTHREAD2_INCLUDE_DIRS}
		${LIBXML2_INCLUDE_DIRS}
		${LUA_INCLUDE_DIRS}
		${NGHTTP2_INCLUDE_DIRS}
		${SMI_INCLUDE_DIRS}
		${ZLIB_INCLUDE_DIRS}
	PRIVATE
		${CMAKE_CURRENT_BINARY_DIR}
		${CMAKE_CURRENT_SOURCE_DIR}
)
```

after

```
                ${LUA_INCLUDE_DIRS}
```

in epan/CMakeLists.txt.

